<section class="content" id="activities">

<h3>Practical Activities</h3>

<h4>A. Visit to a sick person (in person or spiritually)</h4>
<p>This week, seek out a sick or elderly person you know. It could be a relative, a neighbor, someone from the parish. If you cannot visit them in person, call them on the phone or send a message. Ask them how they are, truly listen, and pray a Hail Mary for them —or pray it together if the person is a believer. Then write here how you felt:</p>
<p style="border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:16px;margin:12px 0;color:var(--text-soft);font-style:italic">Visiting: ___________ | Date: ___________</p>
